49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202411051743050660239.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Black Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Uberhardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Black Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      This ROG Strix X870E-E Gaming Wi-Fi is truly superb. It's a desirable card that we can only recommend to you...\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>10/13/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX X870E-E GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Black Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://uberhardware.com/asus-rog-strix-x870e-e-gaming-wifi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202210062120099950666.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pause Hardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ... the ASUS ROG STRIX X870E-E GAMING WIFI stands out as a true technological prowess on the AM5 platform, combining cutting-edge performance with user-centric innovations. ASUS focus on easy installation and usage is particularly commendable, with innovative EZ DIY features that redefine the PC assembly experience. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>10/10/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX X870E-E GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pausehardware.com/test-asus-rog-strix-x870e-e-gaming-wifi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1323/202501240950495060430.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"8.9/10 Overall Rating\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Gadget Pilipinas\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>8.9/10 Overall Rating</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Overall, you have a complete package of everything you need with the ASUS ROG Strix X870E-E Gaming WIFI provided if you can afford the Php 33,000 “package” price. Like in our ROG Strix -E series previous review, the X870E-E is basically a Crosshair board without the branding and the eccentric features.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>PHILIPPINES</span> <span>12/30/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX X870E-E GAMING WIFI Media review Award of 8.9/10 Overall Rating\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gadgetpilipinas.net/2024/12/asus-rog-strix-x870e-e-gaming-wifi-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/202003032021043490186.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Premium \" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Game it\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Premium </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      designed to support three generations of AMD Ryzen at full performance and to squeeze the most out of them\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>10/14/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX X870E-E GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Premium \" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gameit.es/rog-strix-x870e-e-gaming-wifi-review-completa-en-espanol/amp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" ari