em__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202204280021185980888.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"90 %_Excellent\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Gamepress.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>90 %_Excellent</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS Strix X870E-E Gaming WiFi is aimed at extreme enthusiasts and gamers. It offers a lot of functions that facilitate almost any use. It has a number of M2 slots and supports high-speed memory (8000MT/s). Its AI function offers the possibility to use overclocking even for complete laymen. The downside can be the high purchase price.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>11/11/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX X870E-E GAMING WIFI Media review Award of 90 %_Excellent\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://gamepress.cz/recenze-asus-rog-strix-x870e-e-gaming-wifi-zakladni-deska-pro-narocne/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__rewardMoreButton__NCAU7\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Giải thưởng\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentati